# tools/al/ales_gate_witness.rish -- a noise gate: the compressor's threshold turned upside down (ALES51).
#
# Season: the Six-Season double-seat, Season C thread (Lotus - the creative suite) - waymark ALES - rung ALES51.
# Design read: active-designing/date/20260814/20260814-171918_fill-ales51-lotus-noise-gate.md
# Stands on: lotus/timeline.rye (ALES2 -- the Clip, sample_min/sample_max, the range law shape); lotus/compress.rye (ALES50 -- the
# threshold this inverts, re-proven below).
#
# lotus/gate.rye passes a sample at or above the threshold byte-for-byte and divides a below-threshold sample's magnitude by the
# ratio. The selftest proves: silence stays silence; above the threshold is the identity; unit ratio is the identity everywhere;
# a quiet signal has its floor pushed down with the sign held and the magnitude never expanding; a higher ratio gates at least as
# hard and a ratio far past the magnitude drives the quiet to silence (the hard gate); a zero threshold refuses BadThreshold, a
# sub-unity or zero-denominator ratio BadRatio, an out-of-range span BadRange. Purely local -- no network, no keys, no funds, no
# real device, no sample rate.
#
# Run from the repository root:
#   rishi/bin/rishi run tools/al/ales_gate_witness.rish

say "ales-gate: Language EN — ALES51 inverts the compressor's threshold into a noise gate: below the threshold the quiet is pushed down, above it the signal passes untouched. The third member of the dynamics family — the limiter caps the peaks, the compressor softens them, and the gate silences the floor: the hiss between words, the amp hum under a held chord, the room tone in a pause."
say "ales-gate: Style Radiant — the law is stated positively: above the threshold is the identity, unit ratio is the identity everywhere (a 1:1 gate passes the whole signal by construction), and below the threshold the magnitude divides by the ratio so it only ever shrinks and the sign is always held — a higher ratio gates at least as hard, and a ratio far past the magnitude closes the gate to silence."
say "ales-gate: Lens TAME — bounded Clip, u32 span, i16 samples; the threshold checked in [1, sample_max] and the ratio checked at least unity with a nonzero denominator before any write; the magnitude divided in i64 with divTrunc, a gated magnitude at most the input's so nothing on the audio path can overflow; a zero threshold refuses BadThreshold, a sub-unity or zero-denominator ratio BadRatio, an out-of-range span BadRange; siloed to lotus/, no network, no keys, no funds, no device, no sample rate."

let zig = "vendor/zig-toolchain/zig"
let bin = "lotus/bin/gate"

let build = run ["sh" "-c" "mkdir -p lotus/bin && env RYE_ZIG=${zig} rye/bin/rye build lotus/gate.rye -femit-bin=${bin}"]
assert build.ok else "ales-gate: build failed — ${build.err}"

let outfile = "lotus/bin/gate.out"
let selftest = run ["sh" "-c" "${bin} selftest > ${outfile} 2>&1"]
assert selftest.ok else "ales-gate: selftest exited non-zero — see ${outfile}"

let shown = run ["sh" "-c" "cat ${outfile}"]
say "ales-gate: ${shown.out}"

let green = run ["sh" "-c" "grep -q 'GREEN ales-gate' ${outfile} && echo yes"]
assert (trim green.out) == "yes" else "ales-gate: selftest did not print the GREEN ales-gate line"

# The gate inverts the threshold the compressor leaned on -- re-prove ALES50's compressor still stands green, so the two rest together.
let compress = run ["sh" "-c" "env RYE_ZIG=${zig} rye/bin/rye build lotus/compress.rye -femit-bin=lotus/bin/compress && lotus/bin/compress selftest 2>&1 | grep -q 'GREEN ales-compress' && echo yes"]
assert (trim compress.out) == "yes" else "ales-gate: the ALES50 compressor witness regressed under the gate"

say "ales-gate: GREEN — a noise gate inverts the compressor's threshold by dividing the below-threshold magnitude by the ratio; above the threshold is the identity, unit ratio is the identity everywhere, a quiet signal's floor pushes down with the sign held and the magnitude never expanding, a higher ratio gates at least as hard, and a ratio far past the magnitude drives the quiet exactly to silence (the hard gate); a zero threshold refuses BadThreshold, a sub-unity or zero-denominator ratio BadRatio, an out-of-range span BadRange, each leaving the clip untouched; the ALES50 compressor selftest stays GREEN. The dynamics family now holds the brickwall, the softened ratio, and the inverted floor — the next rung can give any of the three an attack and release over a real time base, or a soft knee that rounds the threshold's corner."
